// The per-directive census for _tests_/cases, split out of golden.bit at 816
// lines (#4441's ceiling, the same one that moved checkerdiag). Pure move:
// the derivation history and expectedCounts() only. The dRun/dPanic/... ids
// stay in golden.bit -- name resolution is per MODULE, so they resolve here
// unchanged and re-importing anything would be E0042.

// DERIVATION HISTORY for expectedCounts() below, kept out of the function body
// so its own physical-line count (E0201) tracks the number of assignments,
// not the size of the log. Derived post-merge via
// `for f in _tests_/cases/*.bit; do head -1 "$f"; done | sort | uniq -c`.
// Earliest history (task-3762 x main, #3371, #3370: dRun 323 -> 327,
// dErr -> 137, each a pinned-count merge collision resolved the same way
// every entry below is) is in git blame, not repeated here (#2862's
// precedent: a per-ticket entry may be pruned once it is pure history).
// #3810 then adds 1 run case and 1 ir case, giving dRun=328/dIr=5. main
// said 327, task-3810 said 323 (its base predates this wave). Derived with
// the uniq -c command above.
// #3827 then adds 1 error case (check_interp_generic_call_site), giving
// dErr=138. Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #3861 then adds 1 run case (run_slice_stride_roundtrip) and 2 panic
// cases (run_slice_stride_get_fatal, run_slice_stride_set_fatal), giving
// dRun=329/dPanic=29. Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #3862 then adds 5 run cases (run_slice_inline_basic and its four
// bail-out siblings: bail_handle, bail_forof, bail_call, bail_iface),
// giving dRun=334. Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #3933 then adds 3 run cases (run_slice_inline_bail_lit_ident,
// run_slice_inline_bail_lit_call, run_slice_inline_bail_append_var), giving
// dRun=337. Derived with the uniq -c command above.
