// #4064 (map<K,V>(n), a real capacity hint), rebased onto the above, then
// adds 1 more run case (run_map_capacity_hint.bit), giving dRun=344.
// Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #3974 (nosplit len/cap over a fixed array) then adds 1 run case
// (run_nosplit_len_fixed_array.bit) and 3 error cases
// (check_nosplit_len_slice/_map/_string.bit), giving dRun=345/dErr=142.
// Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #4039 (inline `append` fast path) then adds 1 run case
// (run_append_alias_inline.bit), giving dRun=346. Derived with the uniq -c
// command above, on merged `main` at the time of writing -- re-derive it
// rather than taking this branch's number, since a sibling branch adding a
// case writes the SAME kind of line and the two merge with no conflict.
// #4045 then adds 1 run case (run_gc_zero_body_sizes), giving dRun=347.
// #4072 (std/time Date type) then adds 1 run case
// (run_time_date_fields.bit), giving dRun=348. Derived with the uniq -c
// command above: 348 // run over 589 case files.
// c13ff09f/9a10010: a substring `grep -c '// run'` double-counted the
// `// run-debug` case into dRun; reverted to 348 with the exact-line form
// (see directive.bit's directiveOfEarly, which puts run-debug in
// dRunDebug, not dRun). #4073 (Time type) adds 1 more run case
// (run_time_timeofday_fields.bit), giving dRun=349 over 591 case files,
// exact-line derived. #4074 (NaiveDateTime) adds 1 more (dRun=350, 592), and
// #4053 (LICM hoists the slice buf pointer) adds run_licm_null_slice_header
// giving dRun=351 over 593. BOTH branches wrote 350 -- each correct on its
// own base, both wrong here. Re-derived off disk with the uniq -c command
// above on the merged tree, never by arithmetic on a branch delta.
// #4105 (tuple literal expression) adds 1 run case
// (run_tuple_literal_expr.bit), giving dRun=352 over 594. Derived with the
// uniq -c command above.
// #4270 (fixed-array index bounds check) adds 2 panic cases
// (run_array_index_read_panic.bit, run_array_index_write_panic.bit) and 2
// error cases (check_array_index_out_of_range.bit,
// check_nosplit_array_index_unmasked.bit), giving dPanic=31/dErr=144.
// Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #4071 (the public Zone surface) adds 1 run case
// (run_time_zone_public.bit), giving dRun=354. Derived with the uniq -c
// command above.
// #3840 (field_init accepts `=` alongside `:`) adds 1 run case
// (run_field_init_eq_form.bit), giving dRun=355. Derived with the uniq -c
// command above.
// #3839 (named arguments at call sites) adds 2 run cases
// (run_named_args_forms.bit, run_named_args_eval_order.bit), giving
// dRun=357. Derived with the uniq -c command above.
// #4075 (the `DateTime` type) adds 4 run cases (run_time_zoned_construct,
// run_time_zoned_spring_gap, run_time_zoned_autumn_overlap,
// run_time_zoned_out_of_range) and #3965 (std/websocket) adds 4 more
