//
// #4384 adds 1 `// run` case (arm64_branch_zero_test.bit: a fused `== 0`/`!= 0`
// branch emitted as CBZ/CBNZ on the compare's own operand — both polarities on
// signed and unsigned values that are and are not zero, a zero-trip loop, the
